{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Today's your wedding day, and you've never met your husband.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're the chief of several semi-nomadic clans; he's an imperial prince of the Han people, with whom you have a complicated political relationship. You meet for the first time on the same day you marry, and you quickly find that he isn't the arrogant, prideful prince you'd expected.<br>Get to know him over the night and find out whether he's a spy for your enemies or a victim of political schemes; and most of all, whether this marriage can work.<br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br>35k words (1-2 hours of reading)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One husband, who may turn into a love interest, friend, or remain a stranger</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">8 CGs (4 NSFW)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 endings to the wedding night</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 epilogues and 3 extras after the wedding night, showing how your choices have shaped your relationship</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3814010?t=1750958630","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3814010?t=1750958630","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814010/f4394e6d190343b5099275f210e29842e9e7b44d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750958630","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814010/f4394e6d190343b5099275f210e29842e9e7b44d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750958630","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"The Traded Groom contains optional NSFW scenes. These scenes are accessed through choices labelled \"(18+ scene)\"."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Today's your wedding day, and you've never met your husband.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're the chief of several semi-nomadic clan